    "modifier_terrorblade_13_0": "New Active Ability: Terror Wave \n\n Releases a circular wave that causes affected enemy heroes to flee in fear. Deals magical damage and applies Metamorphosis or Demon Hunter for 15 seconds. \n\n Radius: 1600 \n Damage: 200 \n Fear Duration: 2 sec. \n Mana Cost: 75 \n Cooldown: 75 sec.",
    "modifier_terrorblade_13_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Terror Wave</font></b> \n\n Releases a circular wave that causes affected enemy heroes to flee in fear. Deals magical damage and applies Metamorphosis or Demon Hunter for <b><font color='#eabe10'>15</font></b> seconds. \n\n Radius: 1600 \n Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b> \n Fear Duration: 2 sec. \n Mana Cost: 75 \n Cooldown: 75 sec.",
