    "modifier_terrorblade_16_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Demon Hunter</font></b> \n\n The hero falls into a demonic frenzy, mana costs are significantly reduced. \n\n Mana Cost and Loss Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b> \n Intellect: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> \n Duration: 20 sec. \n Cooldown: 60 sec.",
    "modifier_terrorblade_17_0": "During Demon Hunter, Hero's Attacks drain 33%/66%/100% of Mana from Attack Damage and deal Magic Damage equal to Mana Spent to enemies.",
    "modifier_terrorblade_17_1": "During Demon Hunter, Hero's Attacks drain <b><font color='#eabe10'>33%</font></b>/66%/100% of Mana from Attack Damage and deal Magic Damage equal to Mana Spent to enemies.",
